Column name: institution_name Type: TEXT Description: The legal name of the institution.
Column name: established_date Type: DATE Description: The date on which the institution began operations.
Column name: state Type: TEXT Description: 2 letter postal abbreviation for the state in which the the headquarters are physically located. The FDIC Act defines state as any State of the United States, the District of Columbia, and any territory of the United States, Puerto Rico, Guam, American Samoa, the Trust Territory of the Pacific Islands, the Virgin Island, and the Northern Mariana Islands.
